# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the unit tests (CI: sanitizers.yml).
# Each entry is a process-lifetime allocation in vendor code that has no way to
# be released, never an engine leak. Keep entries specific to one function.

# basisu builds its transcoder lookup tables once per process and has no
# matching deinit (UHE/vendor/basis_universal/transcoder/basisu_transcoder.h).
leak:basisu_transcoder_init
